<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Brandure is an independent AEO specialist agency, working on answer-engine visibility rather than traditional search rankings."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Brandure is an independent agency working on one problem: whether a brand
    appears when an AI answers a buying question.
  </p>

  <h2>Why a specialist</h2>

  <p>
    Answer Engine Optimisation is usually sold as a line item by agencies whose
    real business is something else — an add-on to an SEO retainer, or a slide
    in a PR proposal. That tends to produce SEO work with new vocabulary
    attached to it.
  </p>

  <p>
    The levers are genuinely different. Ranking is about position in a list.
    Answer inclusion is about whether a model can resolve who you are, whether
    the sources it grounds on mention you, and whether your content survives
    being summarised. Those need working on directly.
  </p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>

  <p>
    Measurement before recommendations. We will not tell you what to fix before
    we have shown you what is wrong, and the measurement is designed so it can
    be repeated and checked rather than taken on trust.
  </p>

  <p>
    We publish our method and our category research. If a claim here cannot be
    traced to something measured, it should not be in a proposal — and the same
    standard applies to what we publish about ourselves.
  </p>

  <p>
    Engagements are deliberately few at a time. That is a capacity choice
    rather than a positioning one, and it is why scope is agreed tightly before
    work starts.
  </p>

  <p><a href="/contact">Get in touch</a></p>
</BaseLayout>
